From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:23:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH v2] mac80211: use the JB NSS AP receive policy

The NSS data path replaces the native PPE WLAN ingress hook on AX.
Use the ordinary AP GRO policy when applying the NSS wireless series.
The shared mac80211 patch set remains unchanged for other targets.

Rebase this NSS integration onto the shared mac80211/ath11k patch
series while preserving the local host-path fixes.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/net/mac80211/iface.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/iface.c
@@ -1404,16 +1404,6 @@ int ieee80211_do_open(struct wireless_de
 
 	lockdep_assert_wiphy(local->hw.wiphy);
 
-	/*
-	 * Native PPE ingress accepts MTU-sized frames. Keep AP RX unaggregated
-	 * by default; the ordinary TC/netfilter receive path still runs.
-	 */
-	if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_QCOM_80211AX_PPE) && dev &&
-	    sdata->vif.type == NL80211_IFTYPE_AP) {
-		dev->wanted_features &= ~NETIF_F_GRO;
-		netdev_update_features(dev);
-	}
-
 	switch (sdata->vif.type) {
 	case NL80211_IFTYPE_AP_VLAN: {
 		struct ieee80211_sub_if_data *master;
